rate; the FCC's analog supply is also absent.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"other\",\n      \"components\": [\"FCC2\", \"UART3_FCC2\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"FCC2.48\", \"FCC2.73\", \"UART3_FCC2.3\", \"UART3_FCC2.4\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"NET0117\", \"NET0152\"],\n      \"observed\": \"The two STM32H753 VCAP pins are connected directly to pins 3 and 4 of the UART3_FCC2 connector, respectively. No VCAP decoupling capacitors appear on those nets.\",\n      \"expected\": \"VCAP pins should have the required local capacitors to ground and should not be routed as external UART signals.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (name \\\"NET0117\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC2\\\") (pin \\\"48\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VCAP\\\")) (node (ref \\\"UART3_FCC2\\\") (pin \\\"3\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (name \\\"NET0152\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC2\\\") (pin \\\"73\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VCAP\\\")) (node (ref \\\"UART3_FCC2\\\") (pin \\\"4\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(pin (num \\\"48\\\") (name \\\"VCAP\\\") (type \\\"power_out\\\"))\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The MCU core-regulator outputs are exposed on the UART connector instead of being properly bypassed, which can prevent reliable operation and may cause external connections to disturb or overload the core supply.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.98\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Anomalies are present: both MCUs have unconnected VDD supply pins, and the FCC's VCAP pins are routed to UART connector pins instead of local decoupling capacitors. Either issue can prevent reliable board operation.\"\n}",
